## Laundry

::bg{location="laundry" time="night"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Mangles and a copper, and a chute in the wall with a hatch that is still warm.
<hub id="search" prompt="The laundry is very quiet.">
  <choice id="mangle" label="Look under the mangle" once>
    @narrator{code="0020"}: A child's sock, grey with age, folded very small.
  </choice>
  <choice id="copper" label="Lift the copper lid" once into="run.sawCopper">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: The water inside is warm. Something turns over in it, slowly, and sinks.
    ::fright
  </choice>
  <choice id="hatch" label="Listen at the chute" once>
    @june{code="0010" os}: Is somebody coming down? Nobody comes down.
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" label="Leave the laundry" exit>
    @nell{code="0010" mono}: Enough.
  </choice>
</hub>
